<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Anscript Hub V2 - Hệ Thống Quản Trị Tối Cao</title>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome 6 Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #030712;
            --bg-card: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            --bg-card-hover: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85);
            --bg-input: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.9);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --primary-cyan: #00f2fe;
            --primary-cyan-hover: #38bdf8;
            --cyan-glow: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
            --accent-gold: #fbbf24;
            --accent-purple: #c084fc;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --danger-hover: #dc2626;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --glass-blur: blur(20px);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9) 0%, #030712 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding-bottom: 60px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes pulseNeon {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25), inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.5), inset 0 0 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25); }
        }

        @keyframes statusPing {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.6); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }
        }

        .container-wrapper {
            max-width: 1040px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 12px;
            animation: fadeInDown 0.5s ease-out;
        }

        /* Top Navigation Bar */
        .top-navbar {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 12px 0;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #00f2fe 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .nav-tabs-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-tab-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 9px 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .nav-tab-btn:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        .nav-tab-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2), rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.2));
            border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
        }

        .app-view {
            display: none;
        }
        .app-view.active-view {
            display: block;
            animation: fadeInDown 0.4s ease-out;
        }

        .hero-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7));
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px 32px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-banner::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--primary-cyan), var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-purple), transparent);
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
            color: #34d399;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #34d399;
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: relative;
        }

        .status-dot::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -4px; left: -4px; right: -4px; bottom: -4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #34d399;
            animation: statusPing 2s infinite ease-out;
        }

        .author-tag {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.25);
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1.hero-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #00f2fe 45%, #c084fc 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 18px 0 14px 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35));
        }

        .hero-desc {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
        }

        .stat-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
        }

        .stat-info .val {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .stat-info .lbl {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .loader-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95));
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-cyan);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 18px;
            animation: pulseNeon 4s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .loader-text {
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.85);
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            flex: 1;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
        }

        .card-custom {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
        }

        h2.card-title-custom {
            font-size: 19px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        label.form-label-custom {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        }

        .form-control-custom, .form-select-custom {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px 16px;
            background-color: var(--bg-input);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .form-control-custom:focus, .form-select-custom:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--cyan-glow);
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .form-select-custom option {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-custom {
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 9px;
            user-select: none;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .btn-custom:active { transform: scale(0.96); }

        .btn-primary-cyan { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%); 
            color: #031327; 
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
        }
        .btn-primary-cyan:hover { 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 26px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.6); 
            transform: translateY(-2px); 
            color: #000;
        }

        .btn-danger-custom { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444 0%, #f43f5e 100%); 
            color: #ffffff; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
        }
        .btn-danger-custom:hover { 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.55); 
            transform: translateY(-2px); 
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-warning-custom { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24 0%, #f59e0b 100%); 
            color: #1a1000; 
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
        }
        .btn-warning-custom:hover { 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.55); 
            transform: translateY(-2px); 
        }

        .btn-success-custom { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); 
            color: #ffffff; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
        }
        .btn-success-custom:hover { 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.55); 
            transform: translateY(-2px); 
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-secondary-custom {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .btn-secondary-custom:hover { 
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); 
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-submit-main {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #7928ca 50%, #ff0080 100%);
            background-size: 200% auto;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.4);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: none;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }
        .btn-submit-main:hover { 
            background-position: right center;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 45px rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.65);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .tree-controls-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .search-input-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 260px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .search-input-wrapper input {
            padding-left: 44px;
            background: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.95);
        }

        .search-input-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .tab-item-box { 
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); 
            margin: 16px 0; 
            border-radius: 16px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tab-item-box:hover {
            border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
        }

        .tab-header-bar {
            padding: 18px 22px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45);
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .tab-header-bar:hover {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.75);
        }

        .collapse-indicator {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .collapse-indicator.collapsed {
            transform: rotate(-90deg);
        }

        .item-list-container { 
            padding: 16px 22px; 
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            background: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.5);
        }
        .item-list-container.hidden-list { display: none; }

        .script-card-item { 
            background: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.95); 
            padding: 18px; 
            margin: 12px 0; 
            border-radius: 14px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); 
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .script-card-item:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
            transform: translateX(6px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
        }

        .script-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        .desc-text-box {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 10px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .desc-text-box.truncated {
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .btn-expand-desc {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            padding: 0;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .scriptblox-preview-box {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-cyan);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
            animation: fadeInDown 0.3s ease-out;
        }

        .modal-custom-backdrop {
            display: none; 
            position: fixed; 
            z-index: 3000; 
            left: 0; top: 0; 
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.85); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .modal-custom-backdrop.active { display: flex; }

        .modal-dialog-custom {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f172a, #1e293b); 
            padding: 32px;
            border-radius: 24px; 
            width: 100%; 
            max-width: 640px; 
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 65px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
            animation: fadeInDown 0.35s ease-out;
        }

        #toast-wrapper {
            position: fixed;
            top: 24px;
            right: 24px;
            z-index: 9999;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .toast-custom {
            min-width: 300px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            transform: translateX(130%);
            transition: transform 0.35s ease;
        }
        .toast-custom.show { transform: translateX(0); }
        .toast-success { border-left: 5px solid var(--success); }
        .toast-error { border-left: 5px solid var(--danger); }
        .toast-info { border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-cyan); }

        code {
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
            color: var(--primary-cyan);
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 12.5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-tabs-menu { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
            .nav-tab-btn { padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
            .hero-banner { padding: 24px 16px; }
            h1.hero-title { font-size: 24px; }
            .loader-banner { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
            .tab-header-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
            .script-actions { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-end; }
            #toast-wrapper { left: 16px; right: 16px; top: 16px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="toast-wrapper"></div>

<!-- Top Sticky Navigation Bar -->
<div class="top-navbar">
    <div class="container-wrapper d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
        <div class="nav-brand" onclick="switchTab('welcome')">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-info"></i> ANSCRIPT HUB V2
        </div>
        <div class="nav-tabs-menu">
            <button class="nav-tab-btn active" id="btn-tab-welcome" onclick="switchTab('welcome')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Giới Thiệu
            </button>
            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-tab-dashboard" onclick="switchTab('dashboard')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Quản Lý
            </button>
            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-tab-create" onclick="switchTab('create')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-plus"></i> Create
            </button>
            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-tab-home-config" onclick="switchTab('home-config')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i> Home
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-wrapper">

    <!-- VIEW 1: WELCOME / GIỚI THIỆU -->
    <div class="app-view active-view" id="view-welcome">
        <div class="hero-banner">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                <div class="status-badge">
                    <span class="status-dot"></span> SYSTEM ONLINE
                </div>
                <div class="author-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-gem me-1"></i> CREDITS: HOTHIPTV</div>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt me-2"></i>ANSCRIPT HUB V2 – QUẢN TRỊ TỐI CAO</h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">
                Chào mừng bạn đến với Bảng Điều Khiển Anscript Hub V2. Hệ thống giúp quản lý các Tab, Script Roblox, phân tích cú pháp siêu tốc và tự động đồng bộ hóa lên Server Render & GitHub.
            </p>
            <button class="btn-custom btn-primary-cyan btn-lg px-4 py-3 fs-6" onclick="switchTab('dashboard')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket me-2"></i> BẮT ĐẦU QUẢN TRỊ HUB
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="loader-banner">
            <div style="min-width: 0; flex: 1;">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--primary-cyan); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.8px;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket me-1"></i> SCRIPT LOADER CHÍNH CỦA HUB (ROBLOX):
                </div>
                <div class="loader-text" id="main-hub-loader">loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hothiptv/AnscriptHubv2/refs/heads/main/Script/AnscriptHub.lua"))()</div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-custom btn-primary-cyan" onclick="copyMainLoader()">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Sao Chép
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VIEW 2: QUẢN LÝ TỔNG QUAN -->
    <div class="app-view" id="view-dashboard">
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-6">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i></div>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <div class="val" id="stat-total-tabs">0</div>
                        <div class="lbl">Tổng Số Tab</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i></div>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <div class="val" id="stat-total-scripts">0</div>
